  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We will provide direct food aid to starving farming families affected by poor farm production, hunger and malnutrition. Aside from direct food aid, we will provide small livelihood support so that they are able to increase their food reserves and sustain their incomes. We will also tackle the larger climate change mitigation issues by promoting regenerative agriculture.</narrative>
